.* WRKOBJLCK: the jobs holding or waiting for locks on one object.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=JOBCL BASETYPE='CHAR 11'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NBRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LOCKCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 14'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=THDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=JOBCL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=JOBCL.
:VAR NAME=NUMBER CLASS=NBRCL.
:VAR NAME=LOCK CLASS=LOCKCL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=SCOPE CLASS=LOCKCL.
:VAR NAME=THREAD CLASS=THDCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=LOCKS VARS='OPT JOB USER NUMBER LOCK STATUS SCOPE THREAD'.
:KEYL NAME=OLKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOBJLCK KEYL=OLKEYS HELP=WRKOBJLCK ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Object Locks
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAC.Object . . . . :   &OBJ.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Library  . . :     &OBJLIB.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATACOL WIDTH=39.
:DATAC.Type . . . . . :   &OBJTYPE.
:DATAC.ASP device . . :   &ASPDEV.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LOCKS ACTLEN=4.(No locks on the object)
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD ?ENDJOB JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.)'.4=End job
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD WRKJOB JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.)'.5=Work with job
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKJOB JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) OPTION(*JOBLCK)'.8=Work with job locks
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:LISTCOL VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL VAR=LOCK USAGE=OUTPUT.Lock
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=SCOPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Scope
:LISTCOL VAR=THREAD USAGE=OUTPUT.Thread
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKOBJLCK.Work with Object Locks - Help
:P.Each job that holds a lock on the object, or waits for one, with
the lock's state. Type an option next to a job to end it or look at
it and its other locks.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
